title: boyDialogue
---
// Dialogue Jumper ---------------------------------------
<<declare $DanielTalkTo = 0>>

<<if $DanielTalkTo == 1>>
  <<jump boyFiller1>>
<<endif>>
//---------------------------------------


Daniel: Oh, hey! You must be the new person!
<<play_cutscene CutsceneAnimator boy-wave>>
Daniel: My name’s Daniel. What’s yours?

Dawn: My name’s Dawn. What’re doing at the front of the train station?

Daniel: My parents have gone inside to say goodbye to a friend, so I’m playing with my bike. Wanna join?

Dawn: I think I’m a bit big to ride your bike, but if I get my own, sure!

Daniel: Aw, okay. Well, bye Dawn! I'm gonna be waiting here for a while, so if you find a bike you should come back!

Dawn: I think you're parents will come back before then. We can play another time. Bye Daniel!

<<GoToDestination armature-boy WaypointTrainStationEntrance>>
<<set $DanielTalkTo = 1>>
===



